#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_434.rst:21
msgid ""
"Due to a bug fix, the status codes of redirects may be changed. See "
":ref:`ChangeLog v4.3.4 <v434-redirect-status-code>` and if the code is "
"not what you want, :ref:`specify status codes <response-redirect-status-"
"code>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_434.rst:26
msgid "Forge::modifyColumn() and NULL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_434.rst:28
msgid ""
"A bug fix may have changed the NULL constraint in the result of "
":ref:`$forge->modifyColumn() <db-forge-modifyColumn>`. See :ref:`Change "
"Log <v434-forge-modifycolumn>`. To set the desired NULL constraint, "
"change ``Forge::modifyColumn()`` to always specify the ``null`` key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_434.rst:34
msgid ""
"Note that the bug may have changed unexpected NULL constraints in "
"previous versions."
msgstr ""

